1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:02,774
In this town, when the streetlamp turns red... freeze!

2
00:00:02,975 --> 00:00:05,050
Wait, it just turned bright glowing red!

3
00:00:05,150 --> 00:00:07,169
Do not move a single blocky muscle!

4
00:00:07,320 --> 00:00:09,394
Pip, my left foot is shaking so bad!

5
00:00:09,494 --> 00:00:12,064
Hold still! The town legend says we freeze forever!

6
00:00:12,214 --> 00:00:14,345
Now my nose is starting to itch too!

7
00:00:14,445 --> 00:00:16,574
Wait... who is that walking past the trees?!

8
00:00:16,725 --> 00:00:18,469
Hey guys, what are you two doing?

9
00:00:18,620 --> 00:00:21,024
June, run! The red streetlamp curse is active!

10
00:00:21,175 --> 00:00:23,139
There is no curse, you silly blocks.

11
00:00:23,289 --> 00:00:25,364
Then why is the park lamp glowing red?!

12
00:00:25,464 --> 00:00:27,759
I just taped my red candy wrapper inside!

13
00:00:27,960 --> 00:00:30,144
Ten minutes frozen... for a candy wrapper?!

14
00:00:30,344 --> 00:00:32,365
Wait until you see what neon green does!

